WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.390 --> 00:00:02.320
Can you be choked by a ghost?

00:00:02.320 --> 00:00:05.290
Would Force lightning short out your robo-arms?

00:00:05.290 --> 00:00:07.359
How powerful is Darth Vader, really?

00:00:08.359 --> 00:00:13.060
Young Anakin Skywalker was a Force-sensitive
prodigy long before he was discovered by Qui-Gon

00:00:13.060 --> 00:00:14.540
Jinn on Tatooine.

00:00:14.540 --> 00:00:19.490
Born to a single mother with seemingly no
father, Anakin grew up fast as a slave serving

00:00:19.490 --> 00:00:21.829
Watto, a local junk dealer.

00:00:21.829 --> 00:00:26.109
Young Ani was instinctively good with machines,
even building his own protocol droid known

00:00:26.109 --> 00:00:32.079
as C-3PO; he is also known locally as the
"only human" who can podrace without dying.

00:00:32.079 --> 00:00:35.850
It's clear that his connection to the Force,
the life-giving energy that surrounds all

00:00:35.850 --> 00:00:40.699
living things in Star Wars and the supposed
explanation of Anakin's immaculate conception,

00:00:40.699 --> 00:00:43.090
is stronger than just about anyone's.

00:00:43.090 --> 00:00:47.210
In fact, Anakin's midi-chlorian count surpassed
that of even Yoda.

00:00:47.210 --> 00:00:49.850
Despite this, the boy lacked the proper training.

00:00:49.850 --> 00:00:54.519
When Qui-Gon discovered Anakin, he vowed to
train him, recognizing the boy to be the fulfillment

00:00:54.519 --> 00:00:59.059
of an ancient prophecy that foretold of a
Jedi who would bring balance to the Force.

00:00:59.059 --> 00:01:01.199
Anakin is also a natural star-pilot.

00:01:01.199 --> 00:01:05.750
He is capable of turning even disastrous crash
landings into military victories.

00:01:05.750 --> 00:01:09.590
Although Anakin started out incredibly skilled,
it's worth noting that he struggled to use

00:01:09.590 --> 00:01:12.990
his exceptional abilities until he began proper
training.

00:01:13.990 --> 00:01:18.299
For 10 years, Obi-Wan Kenobi trained Anakin
Skywalker in the ways of the Jedi, teaching

00:01:18.299 --> 00:01:21.390
him invaluable lessons of balance and lightsaber
technique.

00:01:21.390 --> 00:01:25.880
Due to Obi-Wan's training and constant support,
the young Skywalker grew incredibly skilled

00:01:25.880 --> 00:01:31.090
with the Force, willing to perform life-endangering
feats if it meant bringing villains to justice.

00:01:31.090 --> 00:01:34.600
Anakin exemplified this attitude in Attack
of the Clones, when he jumped out of a speeder

00:01:34.600 --> 00:01:40.100
on Coruscant only to land on a bounty hunter's
speeder without coming to any real harm.

00:01:40.100 --> 00:01:44.170
Anakin was so in tune with the Force that
he could sense danger from miles away, and

00:01:44.170 --> 00:01:46.330
even between planets.

00:01:46.330 --> 00:01:51.756
Because of these feats, Anakin quickly became
one of the most notable Jedi in the entire Order.

00:01:51.780 --> 00:01:55.720
During the Clone Wars, Anakin was promoted
to a Jedi Knight and given his own apprentice,

00:01:55.720 --> 00:01:56.960
Ahsoka Tano.

00:01:56.960 --> 00:02:01.259
Anakin's own stubbornness and quick-to-action
strategies were quickly inherited by his padawan,

00:02:01.259 --> 00:02:04.500
who only grew more powerful thanks to Anakin's
teaching.

00:02:04.500 --> 00:02:09.110
For years, Anakin fought alongside his master,
his apprentice, and the Clones against the

00:02:09.110 --> 00:02:13.990
Separatists and their droid armies, dueling
with the most dangerous criminals in the galaxy,

00:02:13.990 --> 00:02:18.510
Anakin won battles against Sith Lord Count
Dooku, Darth Maul, and General Grievous, saving

00:02:18.510 --> 00:02:20.600
countless lives in the process.

00:02:20.600 --> 00:02:23.190
Anakin would even save his master from harm's
way a number of times.

00:02:23.190 --> 00:02:26.780
"You owe me one, and not for saving your skin
for the tenth time."

00:02:26.780 --> 00:02:28.370
"Ninth time.

00:02:28.370 --> 00:02:30.540
That business on Cato Neimoidia doesn't count."

00:02:31.709 --> 00:02:35.019
Years went by, and Anakin Skywalker only became
a better Jedi.

00:02:35.019 --> 00:02:38.970
Though there were moments of darkness that
he would experience throughout the Clone Wars,

00:02:38.970 --> 00:02:41.090
Anakin ultimately served the Jedi well.

00:02:41.090 --> 00:02:45.379
His potential and ability were only highlighted
further with each new battle and every challenge

00:02:45.379 --> 00:02:46.450
that awaited him.

00:02:46.450 --> 00:02:50.970
Perhaps one of Anakin's strongest suits was
his skill with a lightsaber.

00:02:50.970 --> 00:02:55.190
He preferred the fifth form of lightsaber
technique, which emphasizes strong counter-attacks

00:02:55.190 --> 00:02:57.480
with the goal of saber-to-saber combat.

00:02:57.480 --> 00:03:01.430
While it took him years to view the weapon
as his "lifeline," Anakin's swordsmanship

00:03:01.430 --> 00:03:03.130
and form were excellent.

00:03:03.130 --> 00:03:08.917
As a padawan, he even took on Count Dooku
single-handedly, though he lost a hand in the duel.

00:03:08.920 --> 00:03:12.531
In his final encounter with Dooku in Revenge
of the Sith, Anakin overpowered the Sith Lord

00:03:12.531 --> 00:03:16.650
before Supreme Chancellor Palpatine talked
him into killing the villain to progress the

00:03:16.650 --> 00:03:18.790
Jedi Knight's fall to the Dark Side.

00:03:18.790 --> 00:03:23.190
This premeditated murder strengthened Anakin's
connection to the Dark Side so that by the

00:03:23.190 --> 00:03:27.330
time he defected from the Jedi, he was immensely
more powerful than most Sith apprentices.

00:03:28.540 --> 00:03:33.000
Throughout his time as a Jedi, Anakin Skywalker
continually felt the need to prove himself.

00:03:33.000 --> 00:03:37.770
Whether it was his own personal insecurities
about his role as the Chosen One or his desire

00:03:37.770 --> 00:03:42.180
to be the strongest Jedi in history, he always
believed he could be better.

00:03:42.180 --> 00:03:45.810
Unfortunately, Anakin's lust for power only
took him down darker paths, and in moments

00:03:45.810 --> 00:03:49.790
such as his slaughter of Tusken Raiders after
his mother's death and his murder of Count

00:03:49.790 --> 00:03:52.540
Dooku, he tasted what that power could bring.

00:03:52.540 --> 00:03:56.920
At one point during The Clone Wars, he even
saw a vision of his eventual fate, a vision

00:03:56.920 --> 00:03:58.480
he would tragically forget.

00:03:58.480 --> 00:04:03.494
It was these small steps towards darkness
that would prepare Anakin for his role as Darth Vader.

00:04:03.510 --> 00:04:08.900
Unlike emotionally balanced Jedi such as Obi-Wan,
Yoda, or even Ahsoka, Anakin was prone to

00:04:08.900 --> 00:04:10.650
fits of anger and rage.

00:04:10.650 --> 00:04:15.189
This was seen a few times when Anakin used
Dark Side powers such as the Force choke with

00:04:15.189 --> 00:04:17.860
ease long before he actually defected to the
Sith.

00:04:17.860 --> 00:04:22.610
Unfortunately, it also left him open to weakness,
as he was slowly seduced by Palpatine and

00:04:22.610 --> 00:04:24.100
his empty promises.

00:04:24.100 --> 00:04:28.390
Although Obi-Wan and Ahsoka anchored Anakin
to the Light Side of the Force, even they

00:04:28.390 --> 00:04:30.580
weren't strong enough to keep him there forever.

00:04:30.580 --> 00:04:34.740
Eventually, the young Skywalker, left alone,
let fear overtake his best judgment.

00:04:35.740 --> 00:04:40.110
Anakin Skywalker spent so much time training
his body for battle that he rarely spent time

00:04:40.110 --> 00:04:41.640
training his mind.

00:04:41.640 --> 00:04:45.480
This weakness would prove devastating as he
left his mind open to attack from thoughts

00:04:45.480 --> 00:04:46.730
of fear and failure.

00:04:46.730 --> 00:04:50.980
It was for this reason his prophetic dreams
of his wife, Padmé, dying in childbirth led

00:04:50.980 --> 00:04:53.080
him to the path of the dark side.

00:04:53.080 --> 00:04:57.390
Even among Jedi, prophetic dreams were a rare
gift, further illustrating how strong Anakin's

00:04:57.390 --> 00:04:59.410
connection to the Force truly was.

00:04:59.410 --> 00:05:02.630
However, they crippled him with fear and serious
doubts about his allegiance.

00:05:02.630 --> 00:05:06.230
"I'm not the Jedi I should be.

00:05:06.230 --> 00:05:11.930
I want more and I know I shouldn't."

00:05:11.930 --> 00:05:16.290
Palpatine preyed on these fears, ultimately
convincing Anakin to betray the Jedi Order

00:05:16.290 --> 00:05:18.200
and join him as Darth Vader.

00:05:18.200 --> 00:05:22.640
Ashamed of his choices and manipulated into
anger at those closest to him, Anakin attacked

00:05:22.640 --> 00:05:26.830
his former allies and slaughtered all the
remaining Jedi at the Jedi temple.

00:05:26.830 --> 00:05:30.820
Overpowering many Jedi Masters, including
the high-ranking Council member Mace Windu,

00:05:30.820 --> 00:05:34.780
proved how strong in the Force the young Skywalker
truly was, and his new Dark Side abilities

00:05:34.780 --> 00:05:37.090
dialed his strength up to 11.

00:05:37.090 --> 00:05:41.380
Killing younglings, padawans, and even Council
members with ease was just the rush of power

00:05:41.380 --> 00:05:43.410
Anakin needed to become Darth Vader.

00:05:43.410 --> 00:05:47.650
Of course, this was only made possible once
Palpatine harnessed Anakin's fear and rage

00:05:47.650 --> 00:05:52.050
into something that the new Sith Lord's own
wife would soon not recognize, breaking her

00:05:52.050 --> 00:05:53.820
heart and ultimately killing her.

00:05:54.820 --> 00:05:58.150
With each Jedi life he took, Darth Vader grew
stronger.

00:05:58.150 --> 00:06:02.340
Completely divorcing his former morality from
his current actions, Anakin Skywalker severed

00:06:02.340 --> 00:06:05.530
his conscience in a way very few ever could.

00:06:05.530 --> 00:06:09.910
Thus, when Anakin met Obi-Wan on the volcanic
battlefield of Mustafar, their skills were

00:06:09.910 --> 00:06:11.050
equally matched.

00:06:11.050 --> 00:06:16.050
Obi-Wan represented Anakin's last tether to
the Light, while Anakin represented the Sith,

00:06:16.050 --> 00:06:17.780
fully embracing the Dark Side.

00:06:17.780 --> 00:06:22.190
Had Vader not lost this battle, he might've
grown to become an even more powerful Sith

00:06:22.190 --> 00:06:24.940
Lord, and possibly the most powerful Sith
of all.

00:06:24.940 --> 00:06:29.390
But ultimately, Anakin's own unchecked anger
was his undoing, with severed limbs and burning

00:06:29.390 --> 00:06:33.350
flesh acting as the harsh consequences of
his own pigheadedness.

00:06:33.350 --> 00:06:36.710
"Anakin Skywalker was weak.

00:06:36.710 --> 00:06:39.230
I destroyed him."

00:06:39.230 --> 00:06:41.720
However, revenge is a powerful motivator.

00:06:41.720 --> 00:06:45.860
It was this that drove Vader to hold onto
his life and, eventually, to hunt down Obi-Wan

00:06:45.860 --> 00:06:49.130
in Obi-Wan Kenobi and Ahsoka in Star Wars
Rebels.

00:06:49.130 --> 00:06:53.520
This rage that Vader felt towards his former
master even gave him the strength to stop

00:06:53.520 --> 00:06:58.240
an entire spacecraft mid-takeoff, throwing
it back to the ground and ripping it apart

00:06:58.240 --> 00:06:59.680
in search of the Jedi.

00:06:59.680 --> 00:07:03.750
In his second duel with Kenobi, Vader almost
won, but rather than finish off his former

00:07:03.750 --> 00:07:09.307
master, his own arrogance got in the way,
reminding Obi-Wan that he chose his life as a Sith.

00:07:09.310 --> 00:07:12.900
Years later, in A New Hope, Vader would finally
kill Kenobi in battle.

00:07:12.900 --> 00:07:16.630
However, Obi-Wan only allowed this because
he thought that it might help Luke defeat

00:07:16.630 --> 00:07:17.920
Vader and the Empire.

00:07:18.860 --> 00:07:22.800
Throughout the Star Wars canon, Darth Vader
has done some incredible things with the Force.

00:07:22.800 --> 00:07:26.540
In the comics, he destroys a dam that floods
an entire city, killing millions.

00:07:26.540 --> 00:07:30.210
In Star Wars Rebels, he impossibly survives
the destruction of a Sith Temple.

00:07:30.210 --> 00:07:33.530
Yet sometimes Vader seems pretty selective
with his power.

00:07:33.530 --> 00:07:38.597
For example, he doesn't stop the Millennium
Falcon from leaving Hoth in The Empire Strikes Back.

00:07:38.620 --> 00:07:43.268
Nor does he stop Leia's ship in Rogue One
when the Rebels escape with the Death Star plans.

00:07:43.280 --> 00:07:47.310
For many, these signs of mercy prove to be
major plot holes in established canon, especially

00:07:47.310 --> 00:07:49.970
given his apparent power boost in Obi-Wan
Kenobi.

00:07:49.970 --> 00:07:53.610
The truth is, to tap into the power of the
Dark Side, one must give in completely to

00:07:53.610 --> 00:07:58.240
their emotions, and in Vader's case, that
emotion is often some sort of anger or rage.

00:07:58.240 --> 00:08:02.250
While he can still use basic Force abilities
regardless thanks to his prior training, he

00:08:02.250 --> 00:08:06.760
needs an intense amount of rage to perform
the more incredible feats he's known for.

00:08:06.760 --> 00:08:11.180
In Obi-Wan Kenobi, Vader's hatred for his
former master allows him to stop the spacecraft

00:08:11.180 --> 00:08:15.760
from taking off, but once that burst of rage
is over, his power gauge essentially resets.

00:08:15.760 --> 00:08:19.460
In The Empire Strikes Back and Rogue One,
Vader simply didn't have that same desire

00:08:19.460 --> 00:08:26.035
for revenge to pull from, making his burst
of power in Obi-Wan Kenobi both exciting and unique.

00:08:26.040 --> 00:08:29.410
Although Darth Vader was further enhanced
by his new robotic limbs and the suit that

00:08:29.410 --> 00:08:33.070
controlled it all, it wasn't always what it
was cracked up to be.

00:08:33.070 --> 00:08:37.180
The suit gave Vader enhanced physical strength
and a healthy amount of stamina, things Anakin

00:08:37.180 --> 00:08:39.880
Skywalker's broken body could not survive
without.

00:08:39.880 --> 00:08:43.240
Left alone, he would have eventually died,
but with his new enhancements, Vader could

00:08:43.240 --> 00:08:47.500
focus on his connection to the Dark Side rather
than forcing himself to keep breathing.

00:08:47.500 --> 00:08:52.530
However, being more machine than man came
with its own downsides and challenges as well.

00:08:52.530 --> 00:08:56.340
Though Vader's connection to the Dark Side
was still strong, his robotic limbs left him

00:08:56.340 --> 00:08:58.940
with some serious power disadvantages.

00:08:58.940 --> 00:09:03.260
While he could rebuild himself if need be,
he was forced to retrain himself to fight

00:09:03.260 --> 00:09:05.600
without being able to feel his limbs.

00:09:05.600 --> 00:09:09.170
More importantly, Darth Vader would never
be able to learn the Sith lightning powers

00:09:09.170 --> 00:09:11.350
that Palpatine used to kill Mace Windu.

00:09:11.350 --> 00:09:15.400
In fact, the lightning itself would fry Vader's
cybernetics, and would eventually be the cause

00:09:15.400 --> 00:09:17.750
of his death at the end of Return of the Jedi.

00:09:17.750 --> 00:09:22.190
This weakness severely limited the powers
Vader could eventually possess, as well as

00:09:22.190 --> 00:09:24.340
his ability to overthrow the Emperor.

00:09:24.340 --> 00:09:29.280
This is why he would ask both his former apprentice
Ahsoka Tano and his own son Luke Skywalker

00:09:29.280 --> 00:09:31.340
to join him in ruling the galaxy.

00:09:31.340 --> 00:09:32.480
He couldn't do it alone.

00:09:32.480 --> 00:09:35.250
"We need not be adversaries.

00:09:35.250 --> 00:09:40.914
The emperor will show you mercy, if you tell
me where the remaining Jedi can be found."

00:09:41.840 --> 00:09:45.940
The discovery that he has a son would turn
out to be Vader's greatest weakness and his

00:09:45.940 --> 00:09:47.460
source of redemption.

00:09:47.460 --> 00:09:50.950
After learning about Luke, all bets were off
for Vader, who quickly sought out the boy

00:09:50.950 --> 00:09:52.690
to use against the Emperor.

00:09:52.690 --> 00:09:56.560
Between Episode IV and Episode V, Vader would
hunt for the younger Skywalker and almost

00:09:56.560 --> 00:10:00.680
capture him, though the emotional connection
he'd feel toward his son would prevent him

00:10:00.680 --> 00:10:02.320
from killing the boy in battle.

00:10:02.320 --> 00:10:07.090
Vader even crashed his TIE Fighter rather
than risk killing Luke in the Vader Down crossover.

00:10:07.090 --> 00:10:11.710
Of course, he'd have no problem cutting off
his son's hand in The Empire Strikes Back,

00:10:11.710 --> 00:10:15.370
though it's worth noting he did allow Luke
to escape after their battle.

00:10:15.370 --> 00:10:18.880
It's Vader's children who reintroduced him
to the Light Side of the Force, allowing him

00:10:18.880 --> 00:10:23.550
to rectify his mistakes over the past 20-something
years and finally usurp the Emperor.

00:10:23.550 --> 00:10:27.530
Though Vader fought the Light, he eventually
embraced it after seeing Luke tormented by

00:10:27.530 --> 00:10:28.530
his evil master.

00:10:28.530 --> 00:10:32.680
The love that Vader had for his children,
and for Padmé, overpowered all his anger

00:10:32.680 --> 00:10:37.730
and rage, giving him the final burst of strength
he needed to toss Palpatine down to his demise.

00:10:37.730 --> 00:10:42.010
Although this self-sacrificing act was ultimately
what killed him, Anakin Skywalker reclaimed

00:10:42.010 --> 00:10:46.220
his role as the Chosen One and finally brought
balance to the Force, a feat that he could

00:10:46.220 --> 00:10:48.050
only accomplish with Luke's help.

00:10:49.050 --> 00:10:53.460
Though Anakin Skywalker only returned to the
Light Side of the Force in his final moments,

00:10:53.460 --> 00:10:57.630
this selfless act proved enough for him to
appear as a Force ghost at the end of Return

00:10:57.630 --> 00:10:58.630
of the Jedi.

00:10:58.630 --> 00:11:02.130
While not much is known about Anakin's time
as a Force ghost, we do know that he would

00:11:02.130 --> 00:11:07.060
eventually come to Rey's aid alongside many
other Jedi in The Rise of Skywalker to finally

00:11:07.060 --> 00:11:10.630
put an end to the threat of Emperor Palpatine
once and for all.

00:11:10.630 --> 00:11:13.880
Without the strength of the Chosen One by
her side, it might've been impossible for

00:11:13.880 --> 00:11:17.490
her and Anakin's grandson, Ben Solo, to defeat
the Sith Lord.

00:11:17.490 --> 00:11:22.909
According to Obi-Wan, becoming a Force ghost
makes one even more powerful than they were in life.

00:11:22.910 --> 00:11:27.110
In The Last Jedi, Yoda's Force spirit is seen
using a form of Force lightning, while Kenobi's

00:11:27.110 --> 00:11:31.000
Force ghost often spoke to Luke before he
was even ready to see him.

00:11:31.000 --> 00:11:35.500
While it's quite possible deceased Jedi are
capable of a wide array of abilities, we have

00:11:35.500 --> 00:11:39.770
yet to see Anakin's Force ghost beyond the
final moments of Return of the Jedi.

00:11:39.770 --> 00:11:43.810
However, Anakin may have more power now than
viewers could even imagine.

